# Local IPOs: every value the market uses is an option. The Options page, built as the game
# builds it, has a slider for each: the player's four groups (while Local IPOs is on, and always in
# dev builds) and the finer workings in dev builds. Each label says its value. Reads only; nothing
# is changed.
name local ipos: Options has a slider for every Local IPOs value, each label saying its value
local-ipos on
options-preview on
expect-ipo-options 37
capture ipo-options
# typing a number: kept in range, snapped to its step, nonsense ignored; put back at the end
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel 4
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 4
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel 9
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 5
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel abc
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 5
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares 230
expect-ipo-option ipo.gateSquares 250
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel restore
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares restore
# dev builds show them with Local IPOs off too, so they can be set before switching it on
local-ipos off
options-preview on
expect-ipo-options 37
cleanup:
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel restore
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares restore
options-preview off
local-ipos restore
